        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "fa0bce4a-0de8-5459-bded-6f1195feca27",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Broumov, Czech Republic\n- Products: Broumov Airport, ICAO airport code, ICAO Document 7910\n- Organizations: International Civil Aviation Organization\n- Concepts: Location indicators, aerodromes, air traffic control, flight planning\n\nFacts:\n- Broumov Airport is an airport in Broumov in the Czech Republic.\n- Broumov Airport has the ICAO airport code LKBR.\n- An ICAO airport code, also called a location indicator, is a four-letter code that designates aerodromes around the world.\n- The International Civil Aviation Organization defines ICAO airport codes.\n- ICAO airport codes are published in ICAO Document 7910, titled \"Location Indicators.\"\n- Air traffic control and airline operations such as flight planning use ICAO airport codes.",
